{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Looking for a Job"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Great Elevator Pitch"}, {"type": "position", "content": 6}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Discuss factual and abstract information about common everyday or job related topics in both work and social contexts appropriate for the interlocutor"}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts. Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le03ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to get the point"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be direct in saying something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Young man, I am not sure you got the point, but we are currently not hiring."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you ask someone to listen to an elevator pitch."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to graduate from"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to finish a program of study"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Mr. Brody, my name is Adam Bari and I have recently graduated from college with a degree in communications."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "a degree in "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the area of your studies"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have recently graduated from college with a degree in communications."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pressed for time"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "busy; hurried"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am also a bit pressed for time. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "a hectic schedule"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " many things to do"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I realized that you have a hectic schedule Mr. Brody."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to enable"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to allow; to permit"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My diverse skills enable me to make a valuable contribution to your company. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "valuable contributions"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something that is done or given that helps the team or company a lot"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can make a valuable contribution to your company."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob06aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "professional writing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "writing for a specific profession"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: While being new to professional writing, I have been published in 5 medium-circulation publications."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob06aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "circulation"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the number of copies of each edition of a newspaper that are printed"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Adam has been published in 5 medium-circulation publications over the last year. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob06aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to have a knack for"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be good at"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have a knack for making communications materials that are highly readable."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le03ob06aud10"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Let's Contrast: Simple Present, Present Continuous, Simple Past and Present Perfect"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use different tenses to refer to different time frames. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Present</span> tense to talk about:<ol><li>a repeated or usual action</li> <li>  a truth </li> <li> scheduled events in the near future</li> </ol> For example:</br><span class=\"italic\"> I want to take one minute of your time to introduce myself. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Continuous tense</span> to talk about: <ol><li>actions or events happening NOW </li> <li> temporary actions </li> <li>definite future plans </li> <li> changing situations</li></ol> For example: </br><span class=\"italic\"> I am not sure you got the point, but <span class=\"underline\">we are currently not hiring</span>.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past tense</span> to talk about:<ol> <li> finished events or actions in the past </li> <li> several finished events in the past (a list)</li> <li> duration of a past event </li></ol> For example: </br><span class=\"italic\"> After chatting with your secretary, I <span class=\"underline\">realized that</span> you have a hectic schedule, Mr. Brody. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": " You use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect tense</span> to talk about:  <ol><li>an action that happened at an unspecified time in the past </li> <li> past experiences</li> <li>  accomplishments </li> </ol> For example:  </br><span class=\"italic\">My name is Adam Bari and I <span class=\"underline\">have</span> recently <span class=\"underline\">graduated</span> from college with a degree in communications.</span>"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Expressing Time: <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> Clauses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You can use -ing clauses to express time."}, {"type": "text", "content": "A clause is a part of a sentence with its own subject and verb. You can use verb+ing in a clause to refer to when something happens.</br></br>  For example: </br></br><span class=\"italic\"> Chatting with your secretary, I realized that you have a hectic schedule, Mr. Brody. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can also use an <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> form after <span class=\"italic\">ever since</span>, <span class=\"italic\">since</span>, <span class=\"italic\">after</span>, <span class=\"italic\">before</span>, <span class=\"italic\">while</span>, <span class=\"italic\">when</span>, <span class=\"italic\">whenever</span>.</br></br>  For example:</br></br><span class=\"italic\">  Before starting, I have to tell you that you've got 60 seconds and I hope you don't waste my time. </span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "While <span class=\"strong\">completing my studies</span>, I worked on the college newspaper as a reporter, and eventually, as the editor of the art section. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "While <span class=\"strong\">being</span> new to professional writing, I have been published in 5 medium-circulation publications over the last year."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I read an elevator pitch."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give feedback on an elevator pitch (positive and negative)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a new and improved elevator pitch."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find a partner who prepared an elevator pitch for the last lesson, or find an elevator pitch online."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Decide what you like and don't like about it. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Prepare a T-chart. Draw a large T on a page of paper. On the left side of the T, put the things you like about the pitch. On the right side, put the things you don't like."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a new and improved pitch for the same person."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the new pitch aloud."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le03ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le03ob06re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le03ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le03ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 2, "time": "20000", "image": "engenn10le03ob06re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "", "id": 3, "time": "50000", "image": "engenn10le03ob06re2img03.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn10le03ob06re2vid01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Young man, I don't think you got the point. We are currently not hiring.\n<Br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Mr. Brody, my name is Adam Bari and I have recently graduated from college with a degree in communications and ...\n<Br/><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Did you just hear what I said? I am also a bit pressed for time.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: After chatting with your secretary, I realized that you have a hectic schedule Mr. Brody. Before asking me to leave, I want to take one minute of your time to introduce myself and explain how my diverse skills enable me to make a valuable contribution to your company.\n<Br/> <span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Ok, fine. Before starting, I have to tell you: you have 60 seconds. I hope you do not waste my time.", "id": 1, "time": "2000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: My name is Adam Bari and I have recently graduated from college with a degree in communications. While completing my studies, I worked on the college newspaper as a reporter, and eventually, as the editor of the art section. While being new to professional writing, I have been published in 5 medium-circulation publications over the last year. Before doing that, I also worked for an independent paper and an award-winning magazine known as <span class=\"italic\">The News Gazette</span>.<br> I have a knack for making communications materials that are highly readable and inspired by international people and cultures. I'm talented at working with diverse teams, and for these reasons I'm looking for a position that uses my people skills as well as my writing skills to engage others in cultural and meaningful exchanges.", "id": 2, "time": "41000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Before continuing with your elevator speech, I must say I am deeply impressed. What kind of work are you looking for exactly?\n<Br/><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I'm looking for a job that will put my skills as a journalist to work.\n<Br/><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: Let's go into my office so we can chat a bit more.", "id": 3, "time": "87000", "image": ""}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about jobs, professions and careers."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about my experiences "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about my academic studies and my work in various time frames.  "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " 